  "label": "Lethal Force Justification",
  "description": "The concept that law enforcement officers may use deadly force under certain circumstances, often justified by perceived threats to life or public safety. This concept is central to understanding the meme's message, which implies that the officer's friendly appearance is a reason to justify lethal force against civilians. The meme uses this concept to create a jarring contrast and provoke fear or outrage.",
